        "id": "PRRC_kwDOKStajs75pPB6",
        "database_id": 4188336250,
        "body": "This row makes \"a float NaN stores as +inf\" a tested contract. AGENTS.md treats NaN as corruption; this pins the path that hides it. The truncation and tie rows likewise pin today's rounding, with no named consumer. Suggest dropping the NaN->inf and rounding rows and keeping the bf16 bit-exact round trip and partner-zero checks.",
        "created_at": "2026-10-05T20:18:17Z",
