        "id": "PRRC_kwDOKStajs75pPCA",
        "database_id": 4188336256,
        "body": "This is the only check of the packed layout against an independent formula, but it sits after the `available()` early return (line 197), so it silently skips on hosts without AMX. The `at()` section in t_llama_unit doesn't cover it: `at()` and `append_v_row` share `pair_base`, so a wrong formula passes both. Move it above the early return, or into t_llama_unit.",
        "created_at": "2026-10-05T20:18:17Z",
