        "body": "As this line says, nothing can catch a regression here, and it adds a global `operator new[]` overload in a widely included header. It's a correct reading of [intro.object], but since it came from 39a68994465f3fb753623eec18378544be806862 rather than #4698, it'd be good to get @bgamari-positron's explicit sign-off on the approach.",
