        "id": "PRRC_kwDOKStajs75pPCu",
        "database_id": 4188336302,
        "body": "The kernel probes above (bare pointer / other plane's view rejected) are the PR's real contract. Several of these only document structure (test policy): no `operator[]`, no view of a temporary, not default-constructible, `sizeof`/`alignof`. And the three trivial-type checks repeat `static_assert`s that kv_cache.hpp already makes. Suggest keeping the kernel probes and dropping the rest.",
